All,

I have both a minimal/server and workstation RedHat 9 image, and I'm in
need of some FTP mirrors -- it's quite popular. ;)  The minimal image is
161M, and the workstation image is 816M in size.  Is there anyone out
there who wants to help the community and who has a relatively fast link?  
My FTP server seems to have a consistent 5 transfers attached, especially
for the workstation image, which seems to be the most popular of the two.

Please contact me off-list if you're interested, and I can point you to
the FTP site so that you can grab the images to share with everyone.  I
released the images in July and they're still receiving lots of requests,
so I know that it would be much appreciated by many in the community. :)

